spice
* SPICE Netlist for Operational Amplifier Circuit

* Voltage Sources
VCC 2 0 DC 15V
VEE 4 0 DC -15V

* Capacitor
C1 2 0 0.1uF

* Resistors
R 2 5 2k
R1 2 0 33k
R2 2 3 4.7k

* Operational Amplifier
* Connecting pins of the op-amp according to the schematic
XU1 2 3 4 6 opamp318

* Output
Vout 6 0

* Model for the operational amplifier
.model opamp318 opamp
.end